# .gitignore — FX Carry, UChicago Summer Project Lab x Bank of America
#
# What is NOT ignored, deliberately: `data/raw/*.parquet` and `final/data/raw/`.
# The Bloomberg snapshots are committed on purpose so that every number in the
# report reproduces without a terminal. They are the reason this repo is large
# and the reason it is self-contained; do not add them here.

# --- Python / Jupyter ---
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# --- Virtual environments ---
.venv/
venv/
env/

# --- macOS / Windows ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# --- Editors & tooling ---
.vscode/
.idea/
.claude/
